& [SourceInterpretation] treats the campaign as evidence-driven refinement
  + free-text account fields are accidental public-generation burden for the selected 0.8B model
  + finite identities enum decisions and exact cardinality are the essential model contribution in P0
  + deterministic compilation may materialize records only from explicit typed model selections and caller-admitted field data
  + compiler-produced accounts describe the compilation operation rather than attributing invented explanation to the model
  - never: reinterpret model-selected relation kinds as host-selected semantic truth

& [SevenFoldExplosion] isolates the high-leverage compiler seam
  + [fold_1_observation] five versioned attempts distinguish prose repetition unbounded grammar strict attribution and typed completion
  + [fold_1_pruning] prompt exhortation alone is not a sufficient tiny-model interface contract
  + [fold_2_boundary] model owns provisional finite selections while host owns compilation validation and latch
  + [fold_2_pruning] model prose is not required to recreate identity bindings or connected graph shape
  + [fold_3_identity] prompt schema and response-compiler semantics jointly form RequestProfile identity
  + [fold_3_pruning] a changed prompt or compiler cannot retain the old profile name
  + [fold_4_transform] typed field selection compiles assessment and flags into an ordinary FieldProbe
  + [fold_4_transform] typed delineation order plus relation kinds compiles into exact self-bindings and an adjacent connected chain
  + [fold_5_fault] malformed bounded output repeated IDs incomplete permutations wrong cardinality and profile mismatch fail closed
  + [fold_5_preservation] response-backed faults remain independently recomputable from the retained exchange
  + [fold_6_falsification] redigested request or response tampering hostile co-membership and control candidate injection must fail verification
  + [fold_6_control] one typed probe remains permanently ineligible for candidate or latch
  + [fold_7_phase_lock] profile 0.5 is sufficient for the isolated P0 campaign and no generalized language claim
  + [exhaustion_state] is phase_locked_for_typed_P0_amendment

& [ConstraintLedger] preserves non-waivable meaning
  + [TC1] caller-admitted IDs are the complete output alphabet for identity fields
  + [TC2] candidate arrays are bounded by field cardinality and uniqueness is rechecked in Rust
  + [TC3] non-coherent assessment without member attribution remains explicit whole-proposal tension
  + [TC4] delineation ordering contains every candidate ID exactly once
  + [TC5] relation-kind count is exactly candidate cardinality minus one
  + [TC6] compilation makes exact self-bindings and adjacent edges only
  + [TC7] ordinary host validation rechecks endpoints self edges duplicates hard boundaries coverage connectivity contradictions exclusions and uncertainty
  + [TC8] every report names its request profile and replays with that exact historical builder and compiler
  + [TC9] control faults probe faults and delineation faults stay distinct by state prefix and exchange stage
  + [TC10] no compiler output expands latch authority beyond attention-local admission

& [DualHemisphereReview] assigns complementary roles
  + receptive model passes select possible membership across varied order without having to serialize a full explanation
  + explicit model delineation chooses an ordering and typed relations over the provisional whole
  + deterministic host compilation articulates the executable record shape
  + Observer validation decides only whether the resulting record satisfies the bounded attention contract
  - never: collapse receptive selection explicit relation choice compilation and admission into one opaque inference claim

& [DataDesignReview] distinguishes wire record and authority
  + [wire_probe] is candidate_member_ids assessment and flagged_member_ids
  + [wire_delineation] is candidate_id status ordered_member_ids relation_kinds contradiction_member_ids excluded_member_ids and uncertain_member_ids
  + [compiled_probe] is the canonical FieldProbe record from the base specification
  + [compiled_delineation] is the canonical DelineationProposal record from the base specification
  + [request_profile] binds prompt schema and compiler behavior
  + [provider_exchange] preserves sanitized request response and canonical digests
  + [authority] remains the caller field plus deterministic host contract

& [Disposition] supports one amendment
  = recommendation: admit typed wire proposals and deterministic compilation as the P0 provider interface
  = recommendation: retain profiles 0.1 through 0.4 only for historical replay and falsification evidence
  = recommendation: treat profile 0.5 completion as mechanism evidence rather than semantic-quality proof
